; delta-grammar for S5 -> S6: the Strata surface gains a capability clause on
; a definition and a multiplicity on a parameter. Everything S5 could write
; still parses, and means what it meant: no clause is no requirement, and no
; grade is `many`.
(change
  (kind delta-grammar)
  (name "S5->S6 delta-grammar")
  (replace
    (ReplaceChange
      strata-syntax
      (present [module version data def law match case let end telescope index bind import export])
      (present [module version data def law match case let end telescope index bind import export uses erased once affine many]))))
